    "ruleType": "unit-ability",
    "group": "Ares Gunship",
    "summary": "As your [Movement phase](vsdata:core-rule/movement-phase) ends, pick 1 **visible** enemy unit up to 24\" from this unit, other than an **AIRCRAFT** or **[Lone Operative](vsdata:core-ability/lone-operative)** unit. Then:\n\n- Until your next [Shooting phase](vsdata:core-rule/shooting-phase) ends, the picked unit is denied the **[benefit of cover](vsdata:core-rule/benefit-of-cover)**.\n- Roll a D6 per model in the picked unit; each 6 inflicts 1 **[mortal wound](vsdata:core-rule/mortal-wounds)** on it.",
